# Windows batch files: cmd.exe misparses an LF-only batch file. It
# tokenizes the file at the wrong offsets, so a comment line can be run
# as a command ("uisites' is not recognized") and the script dies before
# it does any work. Force CRLF on every checkout, on every platform, so
# scripts\windows\build.bat, build-msi.bat and the MCP build scripts
# behave the same for everyone.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
